# Facts about Ilse Dumont.

@fact ilse.furs
tier: surface
text: Kael's younger sister: white furs, a private snowstorm and coins that freeze to counters.

@fact ilse.raised
tier: personal
unlock: rel(ilse) >= 12
text: The Hollow cult raised her to open a door she has never seen.

@fact ilse.frost_craft
tier: personal
unlock: seen(ilse_frost_lessons) > 0
text: She knows Northern frost-craft better than anything the professors teach.

@fact ilse.grey
tier: secret
unlock: seen(ilse_grey_returns) > 0
text: The man in grey came to take her home. She didn't call for help; she only looked.

@fact ilse.scared
tier: secret
unlock: seen(ilse_kael_reunion) > 0
text: She admits, to her brother, that she was scared. So was he.
